Server init.

>> x := Blob baharu: 65 jenis: ['char'].
# for this test you need set a path to libc (puts)
>> libname := Atur-cara tetapan: ['FFITESTLIB'].
Server pautkan: (
 Senarai baharu ;
 libname ;
 ['putchar'] ;
 ( Senarai baharu ; ['char'] ) ;
 ['void'] ;
 ['Print'] ;
 ['char:']
).
Print char: (x dari: 0 panjang: 1), baris-baharu.
x bebaskan.

